OL,3,GNEWSA'Our #1m toilets keep getting
OL,4,Awrecked'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA block of public toilets in Evesham
OL,7,Fhave been wrecked in a vandal attack -
OL,8,Fwith a hammer being used to smash the
OL,9,Furinals.
OL,11,FWychavon District Council has hit out
OL,12,Fat the "mindless vandalism" in its loos
OL,13,Fin Oat Street, saying the costs will
OL,14,F"ultimately fall on taxpayers".
OL,16,FThe incident has been reported to West
OL,17,FMercia Police, and the authority said
OL,18,FCCTV footage was under review.
OL,20,FTim Lewis, head of client services,
OL,21,Fsaid: "It's just demoralising and
OL,22,Fdisrespectful."
